  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conciliation Resources 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Conciliation Resources 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conciliation Resources (CR) is a world leading international peacebuilding organisation with a focus on dialogue and mediation support in a number of conflicts around the globe. CR&apos;s work span a number of contexts where Sweden has a commitment through bilateral or regional development cooperation and in particular in the EU Eastern Neighborhood Area/South Caucasus and the Horn of Africa, geography that is prioritised in the strategy for Peace, Security and Stabilisation 2024-2028.  

The work of CR is based on its strategic plan for 2020-2025, which is assessed as highly relevant for the strategy, in particular its ability to contribute to all goals by a.) dialogue and mediation support; b.) transitional justice and reconciliation; c.) women and young people&apos;s meaningful participation in mediation and peace processes; and d.) its capacity strengthening support to EU and the Organization for Security and Co-operation in Europe (OSCE). In addition, CR contributes to decreasing levels of violence by e.g. early warning systems and the strengthening of social cohesion to increase conditions for return to previously conflict affected areas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Conciliation Resources (CR) &#xe4;r av v&#xe4;rldens fr&#xe4;msta internationella
fredsbyggande organisationer, med fokus p&#xe5; dialog och medling i en rad
konflikter i v&#xe4;rlden. CR:s verksamhet sp&#xe4;nner &#xf6;ver flera kontexter d&#xe4;r Sverige
har ett engagemang genom bilateralt eller regionalt bist&#xe5;nd och i synnerhet i
EU:s &#xf6;stra grannskap/s&#xf6;dra Kaukasus och Afrikas Horn, geografi som &#xe4;r
prioriterad i strategin fred, s&#xe4;kerhet och stabilisering 2024&#xad;-2028. 

CR:s arbete utg&#xe5;r ifr&#xe5;n organisationens strategiska plan 2020&#x2013;2025, vilken
bed&#xf6;ms vara h&#xf6;gst relevant f&#xf6;r strategin, s&#xe4;rskilt utifr&#xe5;n dess f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att bidra till samtliga m&#xe5;l genom a.)
dialog och medlingsst&#xf6;d, b.) &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsr&#xe4;ttvisa och f&#xf6;rsoning, c.) kvinnor och ungas meningsfulla deltagande i medling och fredsprocesser, och d.) dess
kapacitetsst&#xe4;rkande st&#xf6;d till EU och Organisationen f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;kerhet och samarbete
i Europa (OSSE). D&#xe4;rtill verkar CR f&#xf6;r att minska v&#xe5;ldsniv&#xe5;er genom bland annat
tidig varning system och fr&#xe4;mjandet av social sammanh&#xe5;llning f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka
f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande till tidigare konfliktdrabbade omr&#xe5;den.</narrative>
  </description>
